# Raw per-run smoke Phase 8 transcript captures (100s of KB each, one per
# in-scope skill per leg). They are local replay evidence and were never
# committed; ignoring them is what keeps the toolkit tree clean for the next
# smoke run's pre-flight #4. A `*` never crosses a `/`, so the trimmed
# reproducers under `socratic-first-turn/regression/` stay tracked.
plugins/dev-process-toolkit/tests/fixtures/socratic-first-turn/*.json

# Raw per-run nested-spawn captures from smoke fixture group 8a, persisted for
# replay during regression triage. Same class as the Phase 8 captures above:
# local run OUTPUT, never committed. Un-ignored, they left the tree dirty and
# the next run's pre-flight #4 refuses to start on a dirty tree — so a run that
# finished cleanly sabotaged its successor (STE-565, measured 2026-09-05).
# A `*` never crosses a `/`, so any tracked reproducer in a subdirectory stays
# tracked, exactly as the socratic-first-turn rule intends.
plugins/dev-process-toolkit/tests/fixtures/nested-spawn/*.log
